<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (The next step should focus on improving the packaging process through automated counting and digital verification. Automated counting systems could be used to ensure that the correct number of gloves is placed in each pack, while barcode scanning could verify the product against the relevant order information.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (This would reduce manual counting errors and provide more consistent production records without requiring immediate replacement of the entire packing process. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
